    "regime_notes": "Positive reversed IC in every reported post-warmup regime: 2024-2026 IC 0.196131 (105 dates), 2027-2029 IC 0.014813 (782), 2030-2032 IC 0.054913 (784), and 2032-2033 IC 0.056704 (416). The small cross-section is mitigated by 1,825 daily observations; uncertainty remains relevant.",
